(6500199, 966062, 41337, '<td valign="top">Strange, quirky and an awesome comp.</td>', 'Strange, quirky and an awesome comp.', '2011-08-10 02:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500211, 966593, 41337, '<td valign="top">Looks good, but for me it''s lacking some tension. It could use some shadow play. For example, a bright flashlight shining down on the guy or a large silhouette of the guy he''s being chased by might have given the image more of an edge, IMO.</td>', 'Looks good, but for me it''s lacking some tension. It could use some shadow play. For example, a bright flashlight shining down on the guy or a large silhouette of the guy he''s being chased by might have given the image more of an edge, IMO.', '2011-08-10 02:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500234, 966057, 29777, '<td valign="top">This shot is interesting because of the story. However it doesn''t suggest to me the theme of the challenge.</td>', 'This shot is interesting because of the story. However it doesn''t suggest to me the theme of the challenge.', '2011-08-10 03:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500236, 966585, 29777, '<td valign="top">It seems there should be a lot more emotion to this image. The man with the knife has a blank look and far too relaxed a stance and this hurts the impact of the shot.</td>', 'It seems there should be a lot more emotion to this image. The man with the knife has a blank look and far too relaxed a stance and this hurts the impact of the shot.', '2011-08-10 03:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500240, 966335, 29777, '<td valign="top">this is one a very few color shots that has the feeling of the challenge</td>', 'this is one a very few color shots that has the feeling of the challenge', '2011-08-10 03:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500241, 965766, 29777, '<td valign="top">I really thing this would have been much better without the selective color.</td>', 'I really thing this would have been much better without the selective color.', '2011-08-10 03:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500243, 966425, 29777, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot. The look on her face, the props, and the fantastic shadows just all work so well together. Well done.</td>', 'This is an amazing shot. The look on her face, the props, and the fantastic shadows just all work so well together. Well done.', '2011-08-10 03:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500247, 966469, 103032, '<td valign="top">So far this is the closest I''ve seen meeting the challenge.  A critique would be the model is lit too brightly.  I think a bit darker light would have given this more "mood".  But overall, I like the image as far as meeting/fitting the challenge.</td>', 'So far this is the closest I''ve seen meeting the challenge.  A critique would be the model is lit too brightly.  I think a bit darker light would have given this more "mood".  But overall, I like the image as far as meeting/fitting the challenge.', '2011-08-10 03:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500249, 966455, 111999, '<td valign="top">very nice. I really like the cinematic feel in this photo, great lighting and composition.</td>', 'very nice. I really like the cinematic feel in this photo, great lighting and composition.', '2011-08-10 03:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500253, 966593, 103032, '<td valign="top">Good attempt.  I like it for the challenge theme.  However, I think you would have achieved a more noir mood if the light was tighter on the subject.  He''s holding up his hand like he is being spotlighted/blinded.  So if you were able to concentrate the light on his upper torso, and left the surrounding area darker, this would have been a stronger image.</td>', 'Good attempt.  I like it for the challenge theme.  However, I think you would have achieved a more noir mood if the light was tighter on the subject.  He''s holding up his hand like he is being spotlighted/blinded.  So if you were able to concentrate the light on his upper torso, and left the surrounding area darker, this would have been a stronger image.', '2011-08-10 03:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500256, 966425, 103032, '<td valign="top">Oooo, this hits the mark.  Great moody lighting, nice shadows, great props, and great expression form the model</td>', 'Oooo, this hits the mark.  Great moody lighting, nice shadows, great props, and great expression form the model', '2011-08-10 03:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500262, 965823, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  The smoke is a nice touch.  He''s got a Bogart or Edward R Morrow face.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  The smoke is a nice touch.  He''s got a Bogart or Edward R Morrow face.', '2011-08-10 03:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500271, 966535, 103032, '<td valign="top">Different take in a way.  But it works in that I like the lighting, the shadows, and the props.</td>', 'Different take in a way.  But it works in that I like the lighting, the shadows, and the props.', '2011-08-10 04:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500272, 966245, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice, this is in your face noir.  Phycho-like.</td>', 'Nice, this is in your face noir.  Phycho-like.', '2011-08-10 04:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500277, 966050, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the shadows.  I like how the guy is looking back.  With that said, the background to me is too sterile.  Doesn''t bring about any atmosphere/mood.  Otherwise, good attempt.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the shadows.  I like how the guy is looking back.  With that said, the background to me is too sterile.  Doesn''t bring about any atmosphere/mood.  Otherwise, good attempt.', '2011-08-10 04:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500280, 966102, 103032, '<td valign="top">Like this POV.  However the background is too bright.  Would have been nice to have a sliver of lighting on his face (especially across the eyes).</td>', 'Like this POV.  However the background is too bright.  Would have been nice to have a sliver of lighting on his face (especially across the eyes).', '2011-08-10 04:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500291, 966394, 92577, '<td valign="top">Love the content here but maybe there needs to be a little more light and contrast on the model. At the moment, the lightest area is the blank wall on the left. Good luck</td>', 'Love the content here but maybe there needs to be a little more light and contrast on the model. At the moment, the lightest area is the blank wall on the left. Good luck', '2011-08-10 04:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500293, 965324, 92577, '<td valign="top">great idea</td>', 'great idea', '2011-08-10 04:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500315, 966335, 28427, '<td valign="top">In a way, I prefer B&amp;W for Film Noir.  However, this color photograph works perfectly due to the fact that you kept the color to a minimum.  The red lips are the point of attention and are made up just the way it should. *9*</td>', 'In a way, I prefer B&W for Film Noir.  However, this color photograph works perfectly due to the fact that you kept the color to a minimum.  The red lips are the point of attention and are made up just the way it should. *9*', '2011-08-10 04:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500323, 966455, 49109, '<td valign="top">like a still from a real movie - excellent props and location. wish there was a tad more light on the lady in the back. the bold border was unnecessary here.</td>', 'like a still from a real movie - excellent props and location. wish there was a tad more light on the lady in the back. the bold border was unnecessary here.', '2011-08-10 04:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500328, 966102, 49109, '<td valign="top">great contrast and perspective</td>', 'great contrast and perspective', '2011-08-10 04:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500353, 965436, 135479, '<td valign="top">Love it! The pose, the outfit, the expression. Very good work &amp; modelling.</td>', 'Love it! The pose, the outfit, the expression. Very good work & modelling.', '2011-08-10 05:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500372, 966382, 136703, '<td valign="top">dramatic picture</td>', 'dramatic picture', '2011-08-10 07:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500374, 966535, 92577, '<td valign="top">says it all - very nice</td>', 'says it all - very nice', '2011-08-10 07:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500377, 966102, 92577, '<td valign="top">excellent - composition is perfect</td>', 'excellent - composition is perfect', '2011-08-10 07:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500378, 966454, 28427, '<td valign="top">Great image but in a way the young boy "playing" the mobster role makes me hesitate somehow.  Therefor I''ll only look at the execution.</td>', 'Great image but in a way the young boy "playing" the mobster role makes me hesitate somehow.  Therefor I''ll only look at the execution.', '2011-08-10 07:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500385, 966455, 28427, '<td valign="top">And this is a scene from which movie? Are you sure you''re not a photographer on movie sets? :)</td>', 'And this is a scene from which movie? Are you sure you''re not a photographer on movie sets? :)', '2011-08-10 07:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500386, 966539, 28427, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting - as it should be</td>', 'Nice lighting - as it should be', '2011-08-10 07:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500387, 966245, 28427, '<td valign="top">She plays her part very well :) (at least - I .  hope she <i>plays</i> it)<br/>One small detail on which I''m still hesitating: her right eye in the dark, as it is now, or just slightly visible...</td>', 'She plays her part very well :) (at least - I .  hope she plays it)One small detail on which I''m still hesitating: her right eye in the dark, as it is now, or just slightly visible...', '2011-08-10 07:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500388, 965945, 28427, '<td valign="top">The pearls, the make-up, even the hair-do comes right out of a film noir...</td>', 'The pearls, the make-up, even the hair-do comes right out of a film noir...', '2011-08-10 07:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500409, 966455, 92577, '<td valign="top">classy - this would be my pick for the blue</td>', 'classy - this would be my pick for the blue', '2011-08-10 08:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500435, 966594, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good concept and composition. I think you kind of missed on the lighting. There should be a high contrast between blacks and whites with plenty of shadows. I think you got the blacks and the darkness, but you are missing the light and the shadows.</td>', 'Good concept and composition. I think you kind of missed on the lighting. There should be a high contrast between blacks and whites with plenty of shadows. I think you got the blacks and the darkness, but you are missing the light and the shadows.', '2011-08-10 09:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500436, 966530, 10785, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of grain in the film noir style!</td>', 'Interesting use of grain in the film noir style!', '2011-08-10 09:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500438, 966514, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good use of character and props to give the film noir style. You did good using one light on a 45 degree angle to light the subject.</td>', 'Good use of character and props to give the film noir style. You did good using one light on a 45 degree angle to light the subject.', '2011-08-10 09:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500440, 966391, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good character for film noir style however I think the light is a little soft. i think film noir would use a harsher light. Otherwise, totally awesome.</td>', 'Good character for film noir style however I think the light is a little soft. i think film noir would use a harsher light. Otherwise, totally awesome.', '2011-08-10 09:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500441, 966332, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think the key needs to be highlighted a little better to get it our of the shadows. Otherwise a good storyline and good darks.</td>', 'I think the key needs to be highlighted a little better to get it our of the shadows. Otherwise a good storyline and good darks.', '2011-08-10 09:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500447, 966431, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think the light source is a little soft here. Not enough contrast. It could be brighter. I am sure you used the sun... so what could be brighter than that?? Well, perhaps a smaller light held closer would help.  Otherwise a good story line...</td>', 'I think the light source is a little soft here. Not enough contrast. It could be brighter. I am sure you used the sun... so what could be brighter than that?? Well, perhaps a smaller light held closer would help.  Otherwise a good story line...', '2011-08-10 09:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500449, 966591, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great character. I like the lighting and I think you could have used a lower camera angle to make it more in the style of film noir... aka the dutch angle to give it some bizzareness in the point of view.</td>', 'Great character. I like the lighting and I think you could have used a lower camera angle to make it more in the style of film noir... aka the dutch angle to give it some bizzareness in the point of view.', '2011-08-10 09:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500450, 966396, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the hair light to outline your shape. The key light on the mouth is good. A little bit of smoke would have put this over the top!!</td>', 'I like the use of the hair light to outline your shape. The key light on the mouth is good. A little bit of smoke would have put this over the top!!', '2011-08-10 09:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500466, 965549, 10785, '<td valign="top">It looks like a cut right out of a movie... also looks like it was taken with film. Good depth. I think the focus adds authenticity.</td>', 'It looks like a cut right out of a movie... also looks like it was taken with film. Good depth. I think the focus adds authenticity.', '2011-08-10 09:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6500478, 966509, 10785, '<td valign="top">Film Noir and the lensbaby to boot!!!</td>', 'Film Noir and the lensbaby to boot!!!', '2011-08-10 09:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
