(6500861, 966535, 28427, '<td valign="top">I''m telling you: it was not Al Bino who did it.  It was Kerry Oki!<br/>Nice set up, great lighting. Maybe a burning cigarette in the ash trey would have completed it even more, but that''s a detail.<br/> <br/>Edit: only now that <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=109363" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">mefnj</a>has drawn my attention to it I saw the smoke rising up.<br/>I was so focused on all the other elements/details in this photograph, ashtray included, that I didn''t notice the smoke.<br/>I''m so so sorry mefjn.<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-08-23 14:42:51.</i></td>', 'I''m telling you: it was not Al Bino who did it.  It was Kerry Oki!Nice set up, great lighting. Maybe a burning cigarette in the ash trey would have completed it even more, but that''s a detail. Edit: only now that  mefnjhas drawn my attention to it I saw the smoke rising up.I was so focused on all the other elements/details in this photograph, ashtray included, that I didn''t notice the smoke.I''m so so sorry mefjn.', '2011-08-10 15:06:59.000000', '2011-08-23 15:42:51.000000', 1),
