(6501198, 965974, 94815, '<td valign="top">It''s a terrific shot - something out of the 19th Century and full of "Impressionist" atmosphere. But Film Noir it seems not. So 8 for outright quality (comp and processing) but a 4 for topicality.</td>', 'It''s a terrific shot - something out of the 19th Century and full of "Impressionist" atmosphere. But Film Noir it seems not. So 8 for outright quality (comp and processing) but a 4 for topicality.', '2011-08-10 22:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
