(6501205, 966382, 94815, '<td valign="top">I was drawn to her wrist and ankle away from the diamonds. But there they are and she looks great for the topic.</td>', 'I was drawn to her wrist and ankle away from the diamonds. But there they are and she looks great for the topic.', '2011-08-10 22:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6501211, 966425, 94815, '<td valign="top">A thighter, off-center crop and more of an old movie aspect ratio and this could have been a winner. Great staging, light and acting but too many distractions below her elbows. Still a 6 but could have been so so so much better.</td>', 'A thighter, off-center crop and more of an old movie aspect ratio and this could have been a winner. Great staging, light and acting but too many distractions below her elbows. Still a 6 but could have been so so so much better.', '2011-08-10 22:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6501229, 966539, 94815, '<td valign="top">Why not crop this down to a proper old movie aspect ratio? There''s too much space on top anyway. And a major pain is that I don''t remember any elegant  frames on old movies. OK its a particular bugaboo of mine hating borders anyway but here it is totally contrary to the topic. Still a 6 although I wanted to giv e a 7 for good mood and execution. It''s just not right for the reasons mentioned. My entry to this challenge is terrible and I know it but I had no time to stage something like this. Too bad this misses solely on compisitional grounds.</td>', 'Why not crop this down to a proper old movie aspect ratio? There''s too much space on top anyway. And a major pain is that I don''t remember any elegant  frames on old movies. OK its a particular bugaboo of mine hating borders anyway but here it is totally contrary to the topic. Still a 6 although I wanted to giv e a 7 for good mood and execution. It''s just not right for the reasons mentioned. My entry to this challenge is terrible and I know it but I had no time to stage something like this. Too bad this misses solely on compisitional grounds.', '2011-08-10 22:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6501232, 966273, 94815, '<td valign="top">"Everything but the girl..." is noirish but she seems too catty fashionable. Still a 6. Nevermind.. ok.. a 7.</td>', '"Everything but the girl..." is noirish but she seems too catty fashionable. Still a 6. Nevermind.. ok.. a 7.', '2011-08-10 22:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6501233, 966592, 94815, '<td valign="top">This not only has the mood but the art deco style of the early noirish era. Soo bad the aspect ration isn''t very cinematic but ok as a poster.. maybe. 7</td>', 'This not only has the mood but the art deco style of the early noirish era. Soo bad the aspect ration isn''t very cinematic but ok as a poster.. maybe. 7', '2011-08-10 22:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6501235, 966455, 94815, '<td valign="top">This makes me nuts. What''s the banding on the top and bottom all about here? It''s such a well thought-out shot and cleverly executed that it''s an easy 9 but I find the affectations of the added borders very distracting. I really want to understand that decision so maybe I can see the light. I''m giving a reluctant 7 for capturing the noirish spirit with a bit of tongue-in-cheek in the proper aspect ratio (excepting borders).</td>', 'This makes me nuts. What''s the banding on the top and bottom all about here? It''s such a well thought-out shot and cleverly executed that it''s an easy 9 but I find the affectations of the added borders very distracting. I really want to understand that decision so maybe I can see the light. I''m giving a reluctant 7 for capturing the noirish spirit with a bit of tongue-in-cheek in the proper aspect ratio (excepting borders).', '2011-08-10 22:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6501246, 966473, 109341, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 2 for several reasons and here is why:  1.  The image is poorly composed (the leaves in the lower left corner are distracting as is the light wooden pole behind the gorilla and the top black portion). 2.  The subject is not sharp / in focus.  Besides the subject being severely underexposed there is nothing which suggests Noir lighting style. No shadow/light play, etc.  3 Finally, King Kong was not a Noir film and thus I believe this image DNMC.  In summary, I gave this a low vote because I don''t think this image took a lot of thought / effort nor conveyed the mood of the challenge topic.</td>', 'I gave this a 2 for several reasons and here is why:  1.  The image is poorly composed (the leaves in the lower left corner are distracting as is the light wooden pole behind the gorilla and the top black portion). 2.  The subject is not sharp / in focus.  Besides the subject being severely underexposed there is nothing which suggests Noir lighting style. No shadow/light play, etc.  3 Finally, King Kong was not a Noir film and thus I believe this image DNMC.  In summary, I gave this a low vote because I don''t think this image took a lot of thought / effort nor conveyed the mood of the challenge topic.', '2011-08-10 23:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6501249, 966332, 109341, '<td valign="top">I am giving this image a 2 because I can''t see anything besides some lighter areas on the middle / lower right of the frame.</td>', 'I am giving this image a 2 because I can''t see anything besides some lighter areas on the middle / lower right of the frame.', '2011-08-10 23:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6501254, 966431, 109341, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 3 because it DNMC in my opinion.   I fail to see anything Noir here...if anything the image portrays a happy mood.  Besides being in B&amp;W I don''t see this as anything beyond a snapshot...sorry.</td>', 'I gave this a 3 because it DNMC in my opinion.   I fail to see anything Noir here...if anything the image portrays a happy mood.  Besides being in B&W I don''t see this as anything beyond a snapshot...sorry.', '2011-08-10 23:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
