(6502154, 966050, 110744, '<td valign="top">Nice work on the shadow play, have no idea how people achieve this effect. Maybe the man''s face should have a more dramatic expression though, considering he is about to be attacked.</td>', 'Nice work on the shadow play, have no idea how people achieve this effect. Maybe the man''s face should have a more dramatic expression though, considering he is about to be attacked.', '2011-08-12 00:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
