(6502786, 966062, 93714, '<td valign="top">Great light and tone... good story there. 8</td>', 'Great light and tone... good story there. 8', '2011-08-12 14:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502788, 966455, 93714, '<td valign="top">Perfect</td>', 'Perfect', '2011-08-12 14:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502804, 966473, 125275, '<td valign="top">To me this just seems like a black and white image of a gorilla. Not much Noir happening here.</td>', 'To me this just seems like a black and white image of a gorilla. Not much Noir happening here.', '2011-08-12 14:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502805, 966299, 125275, '<td valign="top">This seems very noisy with not much of a subject. It''s hard to tell what is going on and the easiest thing to see besides the man is a plastic lawn chair and a small sedan. This doesn''t really pique my interest, especially not in a Noir sense.</td>', 'This seems very noisy with not much of a subject. It''s hard to tell what is going on and the easiest thing to see besides the man is a plastic lawn chair and a small sedan. This doesn''t really pique my interest, especially not in a Noir sense.', '2011-08-12 14:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502806, 966472, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is a good black and white portrait of a cat. I don''t feel too much of a ''noir'' feel here.</td>', 'This is a good black and white portrait of a cat. I don''t feel too much of a ''noir'' feel here.', '2011-08-12 14:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502810, 966513, 125275, '<td valign="top">The shadows are harsh and the pose is a bit mysterious, which is good, but this looks too much like an on-camera flash. While this isn''t bad in itself, it doesn''t make for very interesting lighting, i.e. it''s not very moody or ''noir''-ish.</td>', 'The shadows are harsh and the pose is a bit mysterious, which is good, but this looks too much like an on-camera flash. While this isn''t bad in itself, it doesn''t make for very interesting lighting, i.e. it''s not very moody or ''noir''-ish.', '2011-08-12 14:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502811, 965591, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is a really pretty black and white picture of a flower. I''m not getting too much of a ''film noir'' feel.</td>', 'This is a really pretty black and white picture of a flower. I''m not getting too much of a ''film noir'' feel.', '2011-08-12 14:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502812, 966383, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is a cute black and white candid, but to me doesn''t do much as far as drama, mystery, etc.</td>', 'This is a cute black and white candid, but to me doesn''t do much as far as drama, mystery, etc.', '2011-08-12 14:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502813, 966594, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is a nice POV and mood. It''s just a little too dark to tell what''s going on. I can''t tell if he''s in front of a door, or an open field. I want this to work, I just literally can''t see it.</td>', 'This is a nice POV and mood. It''s just a little too dark to tell what''s going on. I can''t tell if he''s in front of a door, or an open field. I want this to work, I just literally can''t see it.', '2011-08-12 14:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502815, 966377, 125275, '<td valign="top">This seems like a candid shot that doesn''t feel like a ''film noir'' shot at all. I think it''s hilarious that the mother and baby seem to have exactly the same expression!</td>', 'This seems like a candid shot that doesn''t feel like a ''film noir'' shot at all. I think it''s hilarious that the mother and baby seem to have exactly the same expression!', '2011-08-12 14:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502816, 966351, 125275, '<td valign="top">I really like the processing on this and the photo really seems to tell a story. I''m not sure it''s in the genre of this challenge, but it''s a nice picture.</td>', 'I really like the processing on this and the photo really seems to tell a story. I''m not sure it''s in the genre of this challenge, but it''s a nice picture.', '2011-08-12 14:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502819, 966319, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is interesting and unique. I wish the snail was a little more defined. It looks more like a hand pointing to a small pile of dirt. I like the processing and dof though.</td>', 'This is interesting and unique. I wish the snail was a little more defined. It looks more like a hand pointing to a small pile of dirt. I like the processing and dof though.', '2011-08-12 14:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502821, 966339, 125275, '<td valign="top">This has an interesting feel in regards to the POV, but the subject is not too interesting and a little too dark. I''m not sure if he''s changing shoes or pants or pulling off his sock. I like the grittiness of this; it just seems a little dim.</td>', 'This has an interesting feel in regards to the POV, but the subject is not too interesting and a little too dark. I''m not sure if he''s changing shoes or pants or pulling off his sock. I like the grittiness of this; it just seems a little dim.', '2011-08-12 14:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502830, 966486, 125275, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the idea of a train-themed film noir shot, however this doesn''t seem to be very eye-grabbing.</td>', 'I appreciate the idea of a train-themed film noir shot, however this doesn''t seem to be very eye-grabbing.', '2011-08-12 15:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502833, 965766, 125275, '<td valign="top">You''ve probably heard this before, but this might have worked a little better if it was completely black and white. The costume and props and lighting all work well. I wonder if a unique camera angle or POV might improve this composition a bit also?</td>', 'You''ve probably heard this before, but this might have worked a little better if it was completely black and white. The costume and props and lighting all work well. I wonder if a unique camera angle or POV might improve this composition a bit also?', '2011-08-12 15:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502904, 966437, 9602, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice capture of the feel of film noir, but it doesn''t seem to be telling a story.</td>', 'It''s a nice capture of the feel of film noir, but it doesn''t seem to be telling a story.', '2011-08-12 17:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502906, 966483, 9602, '<td valign="top">I really like the effect of the line in the image that separates the over from the under exposure.</td>', 'I really like the effect of the line in the image that separates the over from the under exposure.', '2011-08-12 17:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502908, 966062, 9602, '<td valign="top">Nice job of capturing the feel of film noir and also telling a story within the single frame.</td>', 'Nice job of capturing the feel of film noir and also telling a story within the single frame.', '2011-08-12 17:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502912, 966457, 9602, '<td valign="top">The smily face at the top of the frame was a great effect.</td>', 'The smily face at the top of the frame was a great effect.', '2011-08-12 17:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6502914, 966387, 9602, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if you where trying to get the effect of motion blur on the subjects face, but I feel like it should have been continued to the rest of the image.</td>', 'I''m not sure if you where trying to get the effect of motion blur on the subjects face, but I feel like it should have been continued to the rest of the image.', '2011-08-12 17:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503065, 966585, 110967, '<td valign="top">totally weird! I love it! 8</td>', 'totally weird! I love it! 8', '2011-08-12 21:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503070, 966425, 110967, '<td valign="top">Perfect shot for the challenge. My pick for the Blue.</td>', 'Perfect shot for the challenge. My pick for the Blue.', '2011-08-12 22:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503164, 966455, 22459, '<td valign="top">This is very good. Lighting and subject matter is perfect for the challenge. My only nitpick is the image is a little cluttered for a scene from that film era otherwise perfect.</td>', 'This is very good. Lighting and subject matter is perfect for the challenge. My only nitpick is the image is a little cluttered for a scene from that film era otherwise perfect.', '2011-08-13 00:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503289, 966591, 22459, '<td valign="top">nice neck tie!</td>', 'nice neck tie!', '2011-08-13 09:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503293, 965436, 72103, '<td valign="top">A shameless 10</td>', 'A shameless 10', '2011-08-13 09:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503335, 966341, 18374, '<td valign="top">I think his is a bit too harsh a shadow- all of the detail in the figure is lost.</td>', 'I think his is a bit too harsh a shadow- all of the detail in the figure is lost.', '2011-08-13 12:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503336, 966209, 18374, '<td valign="top">Neat effect.  I like the photo, but I''m not getting a "film noir" vibe from it.</td>', 'Neat effect.  I like the photo, but I''m not getting a "film noir" vibe from it.', '2011-08-13 12:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503340, 966363, 18374, '<td valign="top">I like the man''s expression.  The photo feels off balance to me (probably the tilt and the framing), but I guess that is part of the intent.  Nice job.</td>', 'I like the man''s expression.  The photo feels off balance to me (probably the tilt and the framing), but I guess that is part of the intent.  Nice job.', '2011-08-13 12:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503356, 966461, 18374, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of the effects applied to this photo.</td>', 'I am not a fan of the effects applied to this photo.', '2011-08-13 12:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503358, 966480, 18374, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  I think the highlights at the top and bottom of the frame tend to draw my eye out of the photo.  Nice contrast, though.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  I think the highlights at the top and bottom of the frame tend to draw my eye out of the photo.  Nice contrast, though.', '2011-08-13 12:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503359, 966481, 18374, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  Nice lighting work.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  Nice lighting work.', '2011-08-13 12:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503361, 966299, 18374, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is supposed to be.  The noise and shadow seem to be obscuring the subject too much.</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is supposed to be.  The noise and shadow seem to be obscuring the subject too much.', '2011-08-13 12:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503362, 966574, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice- excellent framing and lighting.</td>', 'Very nice- excellent framing and lighting.', '2011-08-13 12:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503366, 965549, 18374, '<td valign="top">I definitely get a film noir vibe from this photo.  I might have preferred a darker background or some darker shadows to complete the effect.  Nice job.</td>', 'I definitely get a film noir vibe from this photo.  I might have preferred a darker background or some darker shadows to complete the effect.  Nice job.', '2011-08-13 12:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503368, 966307, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice- great setting and lighting.</td>', 'Very nice- great setting and lighting.', '2011-08-13 12:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503370, 965943, 18374, '<td valign="top">Pretty good overall.  I would like to see a setting for this photo rather than a pure black background. Or maybe something to add an element of story or plot.</td>', 'Pretty good overall.  I would like to see a setting for this photo rather than a pure black background. Or maybe something to add an element of story or plot.', '2011-08-13 12:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503372, 966332, 18374, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting much of a "film noir" feel here.</td>', 'I''m not getting much of a "film noir" feel here.', '2011-08-13 12:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503378, 966396, 18374, '<td valign="top">Pretty good- I like the lighting outline on the shoulder and ear.  I don''t care for the border being in the picture, though.  Also, I might have preferred a setting or hint of background rather than the blank background for a greater "film noir" feel, but that is minor- you made the lack of background work pretty well here.</td>', 'Pretty good- I like the lighting outline on the shoulder and ear.  I don''t care for the border being in the picture, though.  Also, I might have preferred a setting or hint of background rather than the blank background for a greater "film noir" feel, but that is minor- you made the lack of background work pretty well here.', '2011-08-13 12:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503379, 966592, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice use of lighting, though the lens flare locations are a bit distracting.  This definitely has a film noir feel.</td>', 'Nice use of lighting, though the lens flare locations are a bit distracting.  This definitely has a film noir feel.', '2011-08-13 12:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503380, 966483, 18374, '<td valign="top">This kind of works for me as "film noir".  It''s engaging. and has some nice patterns in it.</td>', 'This kind of works for me as "film noir".  It''s engaging. and has some nice patterns in it.', '2011-08-13 12:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503383, 966121, 18374, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and shadow work.  Nice job.</td>', 'I like the lighting and shadow work.  Nice job.', '2011-08-13 12:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503384, 966048, 18374, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Very nice lighting work.  It definitely has a film noir feel.</td>', 'Excellent!  Very nice lighting work.  It definitely has a film noir feel.', '2011-08-13 12:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503385, 966245, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice shadow and light work.  This looks like it has a little green tint to me, which seems a little odd.</td>', 'Nice shadow and light work.  This looks like it has a little green tint to me, which seems a little odd.', '2011-08-13 12:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503388, 966543, 18374, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow and light work.  It looks a little over smoothed or noise reduced to the point that it looks fake to me- more like a rendering than a photo.  Overall, nice work.</td>', 'I like the shadow and light work.  It looks a little over smoothed or noise reduced to the point that it looks fake to me- more like a rendering than a photo.  Overall, nice work.', '2011-08-13 12:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503397, 966391, 18374, '<td valign="top">Pretty good- I definitely get a film noir vibe from this.</td>', 'Pretty good- I definitely get a film noir vibe from this.', '2011-08-13 13:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503401, 966110, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the lighting and shadows.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the lighting and shadows.', '2011-08-13 13:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503405, 965568, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  I like the shadows and lighting.</td>', 'Nice portrait.  I like the shadows and lighting.', '2011-08-13 13:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503409, 966351, 18374, '<td valign="top">This looks too overprocessed for my tastes- to the point where the boy''s skin looks unnatural.</td>', 'This looks too overprocessed for my tastes- to the point where the boy''s skin looks unnatural.', '2011-08-13 13:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503413, 966473, 18374, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting much "film noir" vibe here.  The lighting is too flat and lacks interesting shadows.</td>', 'I''m not getting much "film noir" vibe here.  The lighting is too flat and lacks interesting shadows.', '2011-08-13 13:19:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6503417, 965766, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very weird with the selective desaturation.</td>', 'Very weird with the selective desaturation.', '2011-08-13 13:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503463, 966591, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shadow.</td>', 'Nice use of shadow.', '2011-08-13 16:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503466, 966594, 18374, '<td valign="top">A bit too much shadow and no real focal point for the image.  It looks like you have some hot pixels that need to be cloned out as well.</td>', 'A bit too much shadow and no real focal point for the image.  It looks like you have some hot pixels that need to be cloned out as well.', '2011-08-13 16:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503469, 965974, 18374, '<td valign="top">Neat photo.  I like the contrasts in it.</td>', 'Neat photo.  I like the contrasts in it.', '2011-08-13 16:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503470, 966335, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice- one of the best non black and white film noir images I have voted on so far.</td>', 'Very nice- one of the best non black and white film noir images I have voted on so far.', '2011-08-13 16:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503471, 966339, 18374, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting a "film noir" vibe from this photo.</td>', 'I''m not getting a "film noir" vibe from this photo.', '2011-08-13 16:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503472, 966240, 18374, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what this is.</td>', 'I can''t tell what this is.', '2011-08-13 16:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503473, 966305, 18374, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  I wish the people were a little bigger so we could see more detail in them.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  I wish the people were a little bigger so we could see more detail in them.', '2011-08-13 16:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503474, 966469, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice "film noir" vibe.</td>', 'Nice "film noir" vibe.', '2011-08-13 16:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503479, 966544, 18374, '<td valign="top">Interesting, though a bit too abstract for my tastes.  Nice title.</td>', 'Interesting, though a bit too abstract for my tastes.  Nice title.', '2011-08-13 16:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503482, 966021, 18374, '<td valign="top">I wish there were more to this- some lighting on his clothes or the background or something to help tell a story.</td>', 'I wish there were more to this- some lighting on his clothes or the background or something to help tell a story.', '2011-08-13 16:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503486, 965823, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting in this one.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice lighting in this one.  Well done.', '2011-08-13 16:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503487, 966274, 18374, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  The contrast seems a little harsh- all of the detail is getting lost.</td>', 'I like the idea.  The contrast seems a little harsh- all of the detail is getting lost.', '2011-08-13 16:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503488, 966593, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very gritty.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very gritty.  Nice job.', '2011-08-13 16:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503489, 966387, 18374, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but I would like to see more shadows in this to fully capture the "film noir" feel.</td>', 'Not bad, but I would like to see more shadows in this to fully capture the "film noir" feel.', '2011-08-13 16:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503491, 965393, 18374, '<td valign="top">Not bad.  I would like to see some more dynamic lighting to provide interesting shadows in the shot.  Right now it looks a little flat to me for "film noir".</td>', 'Not bad.  I would like to see some more dynamic lighting to provide interesting shadows in the shot.  Right now it looks a little flat to me for "film noir".', '2011-08-13 16:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503493, 966373, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice, though I wish there were a little more detail visible in the foreground.</td>', 'Very nice, though I wish there were a little more detail visible in the foreground.', '2011-08-13 16:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503494, 966471, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  It looks like there is some funny editing around his sleeve that looks odd, though.</td>', 'Very nice.  It looks like there is some funny editing around his sleeve that looks odd, though.', '2011-08-13 16:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503496, 966579, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  It could use a protagonist, though.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  It could use a protagonist, though.', '2011-08-13 16:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503497, 966486, 18374, '<td valign="top">The lighting looks a bit flat.  It could use some interesting shadows.</td>', 'The lighting looks a bit flat.  It could use some interesting shadows.', '2011-08-13 16:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503498, 965945, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I''m getting a "film noir" vibe from this.</td>', 'Very nice.  I''m getting a "film noir" vibe from this.', '2011-08-13 16:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503501, 966345, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shadow.</td>', 'Nice use of shadow.', '2011-08-13 16:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503502, 966513, 18374, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very flat on this.  I would prefer to see more interesting shadows to create a "film noir" effect.</td>', 'The lighting is very flat on this.  I would prefer to see more interesting shadows to create a "film noir" effect.', '2011-08-13 16:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503504, 966455, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  I don''t care for the border, however.</td>', 'Very nice image.  I don''t care for the border, however.', '2011-08-13 16:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503505, 966425, 18374, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  This looks like it could have been taken straight from a film noir.  Nicely done.  This ended up being my top pick for this challenge.</td>', 'Excellent!  This looks like it could have been taken straight from a film noir.  Nicely done.  This ended up being my top pick for this challenge.', '2011-08-13 16:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503566, 966264, 76335, '<td valign="top">An intriguing moment but why the heavyhanded processing?</td>', 'An intriguing moment but why the heavyhanded processing?', '2011-08-13 18:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6503568, 966021, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good idea though I''m not crazy about how that shadow bisects his face...</td>', 'Good idea though I''m not crazy about how that shadow bisects his face...', '2011-08-13 18:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
