(6503702, 966593, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting pov.  I like the grittiness, but find it oversharpened.  Also, not sure about the harsh shadows on his face, although I understand what you were going for.</td>', 'Interesting pov.  I like the grittiness, but find it oversharpened.  Also, not sure about the harsh shadows on his face, although I understand what you were going for.', '2011-08-14 01:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
