(6503704, 966110, 96751, '<td valign="top">The only thing that doesn''t feel noir t me about this is there is too much open space all around him.  The lighting on his face, the pool of light he''s standing in, very nice.</td>', 'The only thing that doesn''t feel noir t me about this is there is too much open space all around him.  The lighting on his face, the pool of light he''s standing in, very nice.', '2011-08-14 01:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
