(6503716, 965393, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice set up.  I''d have liked there to be more shadow in the image to give it more of a noir feeling - especially the upper area where the foot of the desk meets the wall.  And the bright spot between the camera and the cap should instead have focused on either his face, or the gun, instead of a blank piece of carpet.</td>', 'Nice set up.  I''d have liked there to be more shadow in the image to give it more of a noir feeling - especially the upper area where the foot of the desk meets the wall.  And the bright spot between the camera and the cap should instead have focused on either his face, or the gun, instead of a blank piece of carpet.', '2011-08-14 02:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
