(6506605, 966585, 75713, '<td valign="top">Usually I don''t put my post comments in here but WTH .. here are my thoughts on my entry .. it was campy .. sci fi movies were made in that time frame .. the man in the shot that scooter wants me to get rid of is my hubby, so no chance of that (big grin) .. I asked him to look .. well, stiff and grade B - he did it perfectly in my opinion.  I am so glad I entered this challenge even though I have never scored this low .. I voted on this challenge and was more than happy to give out scores a lot higher than I received and damn that made me feel good! Thanks for all of your comments. 13 THIRTEEN 3''s - sheesh.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-08-17 07:19:37.</i></td>', 'Usually I don''t put my post comments in here but WTH .. here are my thoughts on my entry .. it was campy .. sci fi movies were made in that time frame .. the man in the shot that scooter wants me to get rid of is my hubby, so no chance of that (big grin) .. I asked him to look .. well, stiff and grade B - he did it perfectly in my opinion.  I am so glad I entered this challenge even though I have never scored this low .. I voted on this challenge and was more than happy to give out scores a lot higher than I received and damn that made me feel good! Thanks for all of your comments. 13 THIRTEEN 3''s - sheesh.', '2011-08-17 01:12:38.000000', '2011-08-17 08:19:37.000000', 0),
