(6506913, 966514, 19825, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I beat you this one time by 0.015 points and all of one place higher. I notice mine had 8 votes of 3 or lower while yours had 15 votes. Honestly, I suspect your shot would have placed higher than mine had it not been for a nasty group of site trolls envious of your ribbon count that recognized your shot and low balled their vote. You may need to start shooting some new models. Congrats on a top 20 finish in spite of the trolls, and thanks again for the advice on my shot.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Yeah, I beat you this one time by 0.015 points and all of one place higher. I notice mine had 8 votes of 3 or lower while yours had 15 votes. Honestly, I suspect your shot would have placed higher than mine had it not been for a nasty group of site trolls envious of your ribbon count that recognized your shot and low balled their vote. You may need to start shooting some new models. Congrats on a top 20 finish in spite of the trolls, and thanks again for the advice on my shot. ', '2011-08-17 08:19:09.000000', NULL, 0),
