(6507050, 965945, 84410, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> Excellent, very noir to me, except for the focus.  Nothing in this image seems to be truly in focus. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>After having done some research on the genre I noticed that many of the photos (particularly the portraits) had a characteristically soft focus to them.I tried to keep that in mind when taking the photo.</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: Excellent, very noir to me, except for the focus.  Nothing in this image seems to be truly in focus.   After having done some research on the genre I noticed that many of the photos (particularly the portraits) had a characteristically soft focus to them.I tried to keep that in mind when taking the photo.', '2011-08-17 10:19:49.000000', NULL, 0),
