(6507164, 966425, 129375, '<td valign="top">Wow Super great, my very first ribbon, tnx for the red. <br/>I would like to especially acknowledge the whole team(Freedomwall) for another successful shoot.<br/>Thank you Paolo for the lovely make-up, it works all the time, tnx for sharing your talent.<br/>Thanks also to Fath, for being such a Film Noir model, very effective modeling as always.<br/>To Gerald tnx for being our lightman for the day.Tnx for the strobes bro.<br/> <br/>The set up was not my style (strobing) but it worked real fine (i think I should consider strobing on my other shoots, hmmmmm). I have one strobe set up behind a DIY window blind(made by Paolo), and 2 continuous light as backlight behind Fath, one to have some light on the background and one directly pointed to Fath.<br/> <br/>And thank you guys for all the inspiring comments, and for appreciating the photo, the model, the make up the styling and for believing that the photo will have a ribbon.<br/> <br/>Tnx DPCHALLENGE for having such photo contest, without the guys behind the contest this wont be possible. so Rock On guys!!!! <br/> <br/>Keep shooting..</td>', 'Wow Super great, my very first ribbon, tnx for the red. I would like to especially acknowledge the whole team(Freedomwall) for another successful shoot.Thank you Paolo for the lovely make-up, it works all the time, tnx for sharing your talent.Thanks also to Fath, for being such a Film Noir model, very effective modeling as always.To Gerald tnx for being our lightman for the day.Tnx for the strobes bro. The set up was not my style (strobing) but it worked real fine (i think I should consider strobing on my other shoots, hmmmmm). I have one strobe set up behind a DIY window blind(made by Paolo), and 2 continuous light as backlight behind Fath, one to have some light on the background and one directly pointed to Fath. And thank you guys for all the inspiring comments, and for appreciating the photo, the model, the make up the styling and for believing that the photo will have a ribbon. Tnx DPCHALLENGE for having such photo contest, without the guys behind the contest this wont be possible. so Rock On guys!!!!  Keep shooting..', '2011-08-17 12:31:05.000000', NULL, 0),
