(6507237, 966594, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by EL-ROI:</b></div><hr/><i> Good concept and composition. I think you kind of missed on the lighting. There should be a high contrast between blacks and whites with plenty of shadows. I think you got the blacks and the darkness, but you are missing the light and the shadows. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks -- based on this and some similar comments I re-edited it to try and improve it a bit:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=967892" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/1031/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_967892.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/1031/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_967892.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/1031/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_967892.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by EL-ROI: Good concept and composition. I think you kind of missed on the lighting. There should be a high contrast between blacks and whites with plenty of shadows. I think you got the blacks and the darkness, but you are missing the light and the shadows.  Thanks -- based on this and some similar comments I re-edited it to try and improve it a bit: ', '2011-08-17 14:09:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6507239, 966455, 97166, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sherpet:</b></div><hr/><i> <b>WONDERFUL IDEA - WONDERFUL SET-UP - WONDERFUL IMAGE - WONDERFUL RESULT - WELL DESERVED</b> <br/> <br/>This is one of the reasons why I want to come back to DPC even if I cannot take photos anymore I can at least look at them and also SCORE when I get the chance to become a full member again .....<br/> <br/>Miss you all from shez xox<br/> <br/>PS...... WHO the silly billy who gave this AWESOME IMAGE a <b>"1" YES a ONE </b> <br/>YOU must be ASHAMED or PLAIN STUPID.....Sorry if the truth hurts </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No, they shouldn''t be any of the above.  There are plenty of reasons anyone might score this a one, and none of them are invalid. They may be antithetical to YOUR way of viewing DPC, the world, or whatever, but they are valid none-the-less. <br/> <br/>Every score is personal, and every score counts.  It reflects more negatively on you, than the the person giving a 1, when you react in this way.</td>', 'Originally posted by sherpet: WONDERFUL IDEA - WONDERFUL SET-UP - WONDERFUL IMAGE - WONDERFUL RESULT - WELL DESERVED  This is one of the reasons why I want to come back to DPC even if I cannot take photos anymore I can at least look at them and also SCORE when I get the chance to become a full member again ..... Miss you all from shez xox PS...... WHO the silly billy who gave this AWESOME IMAGE a "1" YES a ONE  YOU must be ASHAMED or PLAIN STUPID.....Sorry if the truth hurts   No, they shouldn''t be any of the above.  There are plenty of reasons anyone might score this a one, and none of them are invalid. They may be antithetical to YOUR way of viewing DPC, the world, or whatever, but they are valid none-the-less.  Every score is personal, and every score counts.  It reflects more negatively on you, than the the person giving a 1, when you react in this way.', '2011-08-17 14:11:15.000000', NULL, 0),
