(6508770, 966455, 83149, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by smyk:</b></div><hr/><i> Very cool. You remind of the Cencer Man from the X-files.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>First thought that came to my mind, "How did he get CSM to pose?" (For those that aren''t familiar with the X-files, CSM-Cigarette Smoking Man...aka Cancer Man).<br/> <br/>Fantastic picture.  The main character looking like a known actor made me think it was from a movie.</td>', 'Originally posted by smyk: Very cool. You remind of the Cencer Man from the X-files.  First thought that came to my mind, "How did he get CSM to pose?" (For those that aren''t familiar with the X-files, CSM-Cigarette Smoking Man...aka Cancer Man). Fantastic picture.  The main character looking like a known actor made me think it was from a movie.', '2011-08-19 00:36:38.000000', NULL, 0),
